# Dolt commits each corpus write capture adds to its embedded workspace:
# dolt_log's row count (bd flatten --dry-run --json) after the command minus
# before it. Generated by TestCorpusGolden; the flat and envelope runs must
# agree. Regenerate with `make corpus-regen` and review the diff.
priority 1
tag 1
note 1
q_parent 1
todo_add 1
duplicate 1
supersede 1
dep_relate 0
dep_unrelate 0
defer 1
undefer 1
close_claim_next 1
unclaim 1
